    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <p>Steel reuse is one of the most powerful levers available to reduce embodied carbon in construction. Yet delivering it at scale requires coordination across the entire value chain &mdash; Circular Steel exists to connect that ecosystem. We create the space where technical expertise, commercial leadership and policy ambition meet, strengthening market confidence in steel reuse.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
